        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Spacious three-bedroom country residence extending to approx. 243 sq.m including storage area on a site of approx. 0.56 acres just minutes from the picturesque village of Straffan \n• Bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hall, reception area, living/dining room, open-plan kitchen/lounge, utility room, three double bedrooms (including two ensuites), dormer storage area currently laid out as study, playroom, two family bathrooms and separate garage \n• Beautifully presented throughout, offering generous living accommodation and rooms to suit many uses\n• Approached through double gates onto a tarmacadam driveway, the property is surrounded by beautifully maintained lawns, mature trees and hedging, creating a private and tranquil setting \n• Block-built garage with electricity supply, ideal as a workshop, home gym or potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permission \n• Enjoying an idyllic countryside setting just a short drive from Sallins & Straffan village, with its primary school, café, local shop, sporting amenities and the renowned five-star K Club Resort \n• Excellent connectivity with convenient access to the M4 at Maynooth, the N7 at Kill and regular commuter rail services to Dublin\n\nGuide Price\n675,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nSouth/west facing with tarmac driveway, lawn area, mature hedging and trees surround, wooden front gate and an outdoor tap. \n\nReception Area 2.20m x 4.00m\nTiled flooring, fitted light and thermostat. \n\nEntrance Hallway 1.40m x 6.40m, 1.50m x 1.40m\nCarpet and tiled flooring, coving, chandelier, thermostat and storage under stairway. \n\nLiving/Dining Area 9.50m x 6.40m\nTiled flooring in dining area, coving, chandelier, bay window, fitted roller blinds, curtains, carpet flooring in living room, coving, fitted roller blinds and chandelier, open fire place with black marble hearth and wooden surround. \n \nKitchen/Lounge area 4.40m x 7.70m\nWood flooring, coving, open fire place with tiled surround, fitted lights, thermostat, hot press with shelves, tiled flooring in kitchen, coving, shaker style floor to wall kitchen cabinets, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, freestanding fridge/freezer, fitted roller blinds and tiled splashback.\n\nUtility Room 4.00m x 1.80m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, roller blinds, fully plumbed, stainless-steel sink and a counter top with storage cabinets. \n\nMaster Bedroom (Including Ensuite) 4.20m x 4.00m\nCarpet flooring, fitted light, coving, blinds, curtains and wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite 1.70 m x 1.70m\nTiled flooring, partial tiled walls with wallpaper, fitted extractor fan, window, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror and shower cubicle with Mira shower system. \n\nBedroom 2 4.10m x 4.10m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, coving, roller blinds and curtains. \n \nBedroom 3 3.3m x 3.90m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, wood panelled ceiling, roller blinds with additional storage space.\n\nFamily Bathroom 2.70m x 3.10m\nTiled flooring, partially tiled walls with wallpaper, w.c., wh.b. with vanity unit, fitted mirror, shower cubicle with Mira shower system, bathtub, window, extractor fan and fitted roller blinds. \n\nFirst Floor Storage currently laid out as follows:\n\nLanding 4.50m x 1.70m\nCarpet flooring from stairway to landing, wood panelled ceiling, fitted wall lights and eaves storage space. \n\n\nPlayroom 3.10m x 2.00m\nCarpet flooring, wood panelled ceiling, fitted wall light and eaves storage space.\n\nBedroom (Including Ensuite) 4.20m x 4.00m\nCarpet flooring, light fitting, coving, blinds, curtains and wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite 1.70m x 1.70m\nTiled flooring, ¾ tiled walls with wallpaper, fitted extractor fan, window, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror and shower cubicle with Mira shower system. \n\nFirst Floor Bathroom 1.90m x 2.30m\nFully tiled, window, w.c., w.h.b. with fitted shaving light, shower cubicle with Creda shower system and fitted cabinets. \n\nOffice/study 8.50m x 2.90m\nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light, wood panelled ceiling, roller blinds and access to eaves storage space. \n\nOutside\n\nGarage 4.80m x 6.50m\nLight fitting, additional sockets and roller shutter doors. \n\nGarden \nPristine lawn areas on all sides, west facing stone paved patio, timber fenced surround, and oil tank with timber fenced & mature hedging surround. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 243.7 sq.m including attic of 109.22 sq.m \nBuilt in 1970\nOverall site area approx. 0.56 acres\nLawn areas \nWest facing garden and patio area\nPVC fascias and soffits\nOutside tap\nOutside lighting\n\nItems Included in sale: All light fittings, curtains, blinds, free standing fridge/freezer, extractor fan, oven, hob and dishwasher.\n\nServices\nMains water \nSeptic tank \nOil fired central heating \n\nBER F \n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W91 F5Y4\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright\n045 832020\n"
      },
